\]

Now sum up the costs before any additional fees:
\[
$40.00 (final bill) - $7.00 (deliveries) - $8.00 (tips)
\]

Perform the subtraction:
\[
$40.00 - $7.00 - $8.00 = $29.00
\]

Thus, the final price of Stephen's groceries is:
\[
\boxed{29.00}
