\[ \text{Total Inner Volume} = V_{Box_1} + V_{Box_2} + V_{Box_3} \]
\[ \text{Total Inner Volume} = 120 + 124 + 116 \]
\[ \text{Total Inner Volume} = 350 \text{ cubic inches} \]

Therefore, the total inner volume of all 3 boxes is:
\[
\boxed{350}
